  m_text: "<b>\u2022</b>  Unnatural pauses, robotic rhythm or unusually flat emotion.\n<b>\u2022</b> 
    Background noise that suddenly changes or disappears.\n<b>\u2022</b>  Words that
    sound blurred or \"smeared\" at the edges.\n<b>\u2022</b>  Always verify urgent
    voice requests through a second, trusted channel."
