  m_text: Audio deepfakes became widely accessible in the early 2020s as text-to-speech
    and voice-conversion models rapidly improved. Today only a few seconds of sample
    audio can be enough to build a usable clone, which makes the technology both
    powerful and easy to misuse.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
